          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "16 S Data: A blastn search in GenBank to find matching sequences to the 16 S sequence gave a very close match with MG 979369, a sequence from a O. tenuis originating from the U. S. Virgin Islands (A. G. Collins, pers. comm.). The sequence divergence was only 0.5 %.",
